ontents": [{"content": "engenn10le09ob02re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 0}], "id": 0}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"title": "", "id": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn10le09ob02re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn10le09ob02re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn10le09ob02re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn10le09ob02re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Hi. Is this a good time?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Yes, Kristi. Come in please. I wasn't sure if you were clear on the tasks that needed completing this week.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Well, I have an idea, but going over them again would be good.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Okay. Let's have a look at what needs to take precedence. First, we have two chapters of a manuscript that need to be edited. I'll just remind you that our in-house style guidelines need to be followed. Errors in grammar, spelling and consistency need to be identified. You can pick up the manuscript from Rob, and he can also give you our style guide. Talking to Rob about the style guide will make it clearer. These chapters need to be completed by Thursday, end of day."}, {"time": "41000", "image": "engenn10le09ob02re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Okay. Completing that editing will be a priority.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Great. At this stage you have the liberty to rewrite and make changes as you see fit. Checking for errors of fact also needs to be done. Please be meticulous.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Yes, of course. I will focus my attention on scrutinizing the texts.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Excellent. We also have some layout that you can do. It involves positioning photos on the pages of a manuscript. Again, using the style guide will make this easy for you."}, {"time": "71500", "image": "engenn10le09ob02re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Great. And checking with the other copy editors will ensure that I'm doing things correctly.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Are you good at writing headlines and captions?<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I don't have much experience with it but I plan on developing this skill.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: That's great! As your editor, I will commit to training you and growing your skills. So, make the editing your first priority and check back with me later about the layout and captions.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I will. Thank you."}]}}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "id": 0}]}